WEBVTT

00:03.910 --> 00:07.650
Now is the time for this newly
wedded wife to sleep with you

00:07.650 --> 00:10.660
to strengthen the bond between us.

00:11.120 --> 00:14.990
In that case, I should sleep
the closest to him.

00:15.540 --> 00:18.410
I share the deepest bond with him.

00:18.410 --> 00:21.580
I should be right next to him.

00:22.090 --> 00:24.880
I'd like to sleep in the middle.

00:24.880 --> 00:26.050
Huh?

00:27.760 --> 00:30.090
I think I'll sleep in my own bedroom.

00:30.090 --> 00:31.470
This is ridiculous.

00:31.470 --> 00:34.510
No. The more, the merrier.

00:35.060 --> 00:38.560
Distance will hinder
the channeling of mana.

00:38.560 --> 00:41.060
Therefore, you must stay close to him.

00:41.910 --> 00:43.190
Well...

00:43.190 --> 00:45.150
It's just a little tearing of a wound.

00:45.150 --> 00:47.190
It's not as serious as you think.

00:47.190 --> 00:49.280
Satou, shut up!

00:49.860 --> 00:50.780
Yes, madam.

00:50.780 --> 00:54.620
Sleeping with everyone here
feels too weird!

00:54.620 --> 00:57.040
We should take your feelings
into consideration.

00:57.040 --> 01:00.750
Hey, didn't you just tell him to shut up?

01:01.620 --> 01:03.710
You're getting on my nerves!

01:03.710 --> 01:05.300
Please calm down.

01:05.710 --> 01:06.960
In this situation,

01:06.960 --> 01:09.670
my instinct as a man
should be cheering!

01:10.010 --> 01:13.230
But I can't follow my instinct
and accept this madness.

01:14.600 --> 01:16.510
Everyone, listen to me.

01:18.730 --> 01:20.310
Whatever happens,

01:20.310 --> 01:23.020
Hime always means the most to me.

01:24.150 --> 01:25.520
Satou...

01:26.570 --> 01:28.690
I'm aware of that.

01:28.690 --> 01:31.470
I don't really care about
my ranking in your heart.

01:31.470 --> 01:33.200
I will wait for as long as it takes.

01:33.660 --> 01:36.950
A brief moment of love
is all that I ask.

01:36.950 --> 01:39.540
I'm also fine with any method.

01:40.000 --> 01:44.960
As long as you carry out your duty,
I don't mind it.

01:44.960 --> 01:47.880
I will do anything for your sake.

01:48.710 --> 01:49.920
What now?

01:50.380 --> 01:52.010
They weren't listening at all.

01:53.830 --> 01:55.010
Satou.

01:55.010 --> 01:59.060
You don't have the slightest
sympathy for the poor girls

01:59.060 --> 02:00.930
tortured by this ill fate.

02:02.520 --> 02:04.730
Therefore...

02:04.960 --> 02:07.070
...we shall have our way with you!

02:08.229 --> 02:09.820
Hold on, Granart!

02:12.150 --> 02:16.370
Ring King, my heart and soul are all yours.

02:17.410 --> 02:19.950
Hold on... When did you get naked?!

02:19.950 --> 02:25.500
Lord Satou, please teach me
everything you know.

02:25.500 --> 02:27.040
Not you too, Nephrites!

02:27.040 --> 02:28.290
What is going on here?!

02:29.960 --> 02:33.090
It's not bad this way.

02:33.090 --> 02:34.720
Not bad...

02:34.720 --> 02:36.760
Wait! That's not the point!

02:40.100 --> 02:43.810
What is it? Why are you hesitating,

02:43.810 --> 02:45.310
Ring King Satou?

02:45.310 --> 02:46.980
Who's there?!

02:46.980 --> 02:50.150
Follow your power.
Follow your desires.

02:50.150 --> 02:52.280
Just seize everything!

02:52.860 --> 02:56.200
No. That still puts me
in a tough situation here...

02:56.200 --> 02:58.370
I can't be with everyone at the same time.

02:58.370 --> 03:01.080
Besides, I already have...

03:03.580 --> 03:05.460
You seem troubled.

03:05.460 --> 03:07.500
You're the worst, Satou.

03:07.500 --> 03:08.540
Hime?

03:08.880 --> 03:10.170
No! You got it all wrong!

03:10.170 --> 03:11.210
This is just...

03:12.420 --> 03:13.460
Hime!

03:13.460 --> 03:15.630
You're the one I love the most!

03:18.760 --> 03:20.050
A dream?

03:21.720 --> 03:23.220
This can't go on forever.

03:36.110 --> 03:38.780
Hime, let's go out today.

03:39.990 --> 03:40.950
Huh?

03:42.090 --> 03:42.990
What?

03:54.010 --> 04:01.260
TALES OF WEDDING RINGS

05:15.380 --> 05:17.350
Well... You know...

05:17.350 --> 05:20.760
We've been staying in the palace
ever since we came to the Kingdom of Water.

05:20.760 --> 05:23.010
I want to check out other places.

05:23.840 --> 05:25.510
That's a nice idea.

05:25.510 --> 05:26.850
It's going to be so much fun.

05:27.120 --> 05:28.850
Ah, sorry.

05:28.850 --> 05:31.310
I only want to go with Hime.

05:32.020 --> 05:35.940
Are you just going to leave me behind?

05:36.900 --> 05:41.160
What is all the noise
so early in the morning?

05:42.490 --> 05:47.120
The Ring King needs rest
before he recovers his power.

05:47.120 --> 05:51.870
As long as you stay out of trouble,
you can go anywhere you want.

05:53.080 --> 05:54.880
Okay, I got it.

05:54.880 --> 05:56.710
Leave this place to me.

05:56.710 --> 05:59.760
You two can have fun.

05:59.760 --> 06:01.840
Right, Nephrites?

06:02.590 --> 06:03.680
Yes...

06:03.680 --> 06:04.640
Are you sure?

06:04.640 --> 06:06.470
You can count on me.

06:06.470 --> 06:07.680
Thanks.

06:08.890 --> 06:12.230
I thought Granart would be
against it the most.

06:13.060 --> 06:14.770
Well, whatever.
This is great.

06:17.570 --> 06:19.230
I'm so excited.

06:23.280 --> 06:26.220
The soap form Saphir gave me smells great.

06:26.680 --> 06:28.090
I should use more of it.

06:29.830 --> 06:33.210
Hime, I love the scent of your body.

06:34.040 --> 06:35.500
I can't hold it anymore.

06:37.460 --> 06:39.000
Nah, just kidding!

06:48.260 --> 06:50.060
What?!

06:50.060 --> 06:52.850
You're asking me for an allowance?!

06:52.850 --> 06:55.650
I'd like to go out with Hime.

06:55.650 --> 06:58.440
I don't have any money from this world.

06:59.770 --> 07:01.820
I see.

07:01.820 --> 07:04.750
So, how far will you take it?

07:04.750 --> 07:06.700
We are checking out
the surrounding areas.

07:06.700 --> 07:10.580
I mean your relationship with Hime.

07:10.580 --> 07:13.430
Don't ask me that all of a sudden.

07:14.040 --> 07:15.410
Don't worry.

07:16.080 --> 07:18.540
I threw in a little extra money for you.

07:19.040 --> 07:21.000
For your accommodation.

07:21.000 --> 07:23.420
It's all right to spend the night outside.

07:23.420 --> 07:26.180
I told you! That's not the plan!

07:26.180 --> 07:27.550
Sorry for the wait, Satou.

07:29.100 --> 07:33.180
This world is not the same
as the world you came from.

07:33.180 --> 07:37.520
Don't let others' opinions bother you
and give it your best, young lad!

07:43.730 --> 07:45.990
Where are we going?

07:45.990 --> 07:49.740
I asked Saphir for a list of attractions.
Everything is planned.

07:52.990 --> 07:56.710
Are you sure we should
follow them like this?

07:57.000 --> 07:59.170
We are his wives, too.

07:59.170 --> 08:03.460
We have the right to be treated
as Krystal's equals.

08:03.460 --> 08:04.960
I see.

08:04.960 --> 08:08.260
Therefore, we must pay close attention
to their relationship.

08:08.260 --> 08:11.470
If they ever get it done, we can use it
as leverage against Satou.

08:11.470 --> 08:12.720
I get it now.

08:12.720 --> 08:16.230
I thought you dragged me out
for something important.

08:16.230 --> 08:17.560
So this is why we're here.

08:17.560 --> 08:18.770
Just do your—

08:18.770 --> 08:21.060
All right, let's follow them.

08:25.440 --> 08:28.030
You must be the legendary Ring King, right?

08:28.030 --> 08:29.660
Welcome.

08:29.660 --> 08:30.570
Yes.

08:30.570 --> 08:33.659
To think you actually won
the heart of our proud Princess Saphir.

08:33.659 --> 08:35.409
She may be intelligent,

08:35.409 --> 08:37.039
but she's far from likable.

08:39.210 --> 08:41.419
How rude.
I'll remember you.

08:43.130 --> 08:45.630
You look surprisingly mediocre.

08:45.630 --> 08:47.630
I thought you'd be a lot more muscular.

08:47.630 --> 08:49.340
Can I get your autograph?

08:50.720 --> 08:52.340
I'm off-duty at the moment.

08:53.220 --> 08:55.610
This doesn't feel like a date.

08:57.390 --> 09:00.020
Well, Satou seems to be having fun.

09:00.020 --> 09:01.520
That's good enough.

09:01.520 --> 09:05.690
Satou isn't the Ring King today.

09:05.690 --> 09:09.360
He is the normal boy I used to know.

09:09.360 --> 09:11.030
Knowing that fills me with joy.

09:12.950 --> 09:18.830
When was the last time
Satou actually asked me out?

09:20.540 --> 09:21.720
What is this?

09:22.170 --> 09:24.460
An authentic eel pie.

09:26.300 --> 09:29.510
It was me who asked him out
during the summer festival.

09:30.050 --> 09:34.010
I thought I'd never see him again.

09:35.850 --> 09:38.600
Thank you for coming here, Satou.

09:42.770 --> 09:44.480
W-What's wrong?

09:45.190 --> 09:48.030
You have a smudge on your face.

09:48.400 --> 09:50.190
Don't be so clumsy.

09:50.190 --> 09:52.990
The mood is looking good.

09:53.740 --> 09:55.570
I envy them.

09:56.700 --> 09:59.700
And I also feel kind of lonely.

10:00.040 --> 10:02.870
Don't let this dishearten you.

10:02.870 --> 10:07.210
It's common knowledge in his world
that one can only have one lover.

10:07.210 --> 10:10.190
It's nothing more than a concept.

10:10.630 --> 10:12.760
The world won't change because of it.

10:12.760 --> 10:15.430
All we need to do is to change his mind.

10:15.800 --> 10:17.490
You sound imposing.

10:17.490 --> 10:20.230
Nothing can be done
unless you show some determination.

10:24.650 --> 10:25.940
A park?

10:26.270 --> 10:29.450
Well, this is a place where
people go on dates.

10:29.450 --> 10:31.320
I never went on a date,
so I don't know.

10:31.320 --> 10:33.100
Me neither.

10:40.290 --> 10:42.660
There is a fishing pond.

10:42.660 --> 10:44.000
What is this place?

10:44.000 --> 10:45.670
What is it?

10:59.350 --> 11:04.530
When two people in love kiss each other here,
they will be together forever.

11:04.530 --> 11:06.310
Such is the legend of this fountain.

11:06.310 --> 11:08.480
What? We should go in there...

11:08.480 --> 11:12.990
It's just a rumor that started
after I was born.

11:12.990 --> 11:14.320
This is so silly.

11:21.200 --> 11:22.230
She is looking at me!

11:23.620 --> 11:26.620
Is she waiting for me
to make the first move?

11:29.460 --> 11:30.750
Very well.

11:45.810 --> 11:49.790
No! Doing this in public is...

11:50.180 --> 11:51.020
...a little...!

11:52.190 --> 11:54.280
Y-Yeah.

11:55.530 --> 11:56.780
Speaking of that,

11:56.780 --> 12:01.780
I rarely get a chance to look
at Hime's face so closely.

12:02.370 --> 12:04.080
Well, Satou,

12:05.540 --> 12:09.750
are you too embarrassed to kiss me?

12:11.420 --> 12:13.130
Just as I thought.

12:14.380 --> 12:15.800
For me, you are...

12:18.880 --> 12:20.510
I can't stand this anymore.

12:20.510 --> 12:22.350
I'm heading back.

12:22.350 --> 12:23.970
Yeah.

12:23.970 --> 12:26.270
It seems a little mean to keep watching.

12:27.180 --> 12:28.310
You guys are no fun.

12:28.770 --> 12:31.940
That being said, I doubt they'd
make any progress today.

12:31.940 --> 12:34.480
Let's hope they do better
in the future.

12:36.270 --> 12:38.110
What's so funny, Nephrites?

12:38.570 --> 12:43.330
I've never gone out
and had fun with friends.

12:43.330 --> 12:45.080
I'm so happy right now.

12:45.330 --> 12:47.960
Friends, huh?

12:48.410 --> 12:52.420
Don't you think the age gap
is too big for us to be friends?

12:56.840 --> 12:59.090
S-Sorry about that.

12:59.550 --> 13:01.390
MAGIC ICE CREAM

13:01.390 --> 13:02.890
MAGIC ICE CREAM
We'll have two, please.

13:02.890 --> 13:03.890
MAGIC ICE CREAM
Right away.

13:04.220 --> 13:05.680
Are you two tourists?

13:05.680 --> 13:08.140
Or are you on honeymoon?

13:16.440 --> 13:20.490
Here! My special service
for the match made in heaven!

13:22.030 --> 13:23.410
This large portion?!

13:33.580 --> 13:37.380
This is the world where you were born.

13:38.260 --> 13:41.470
That's why I thought I should protect it.

13:43.340 --> 13:46.560
But it's the same today.

13:46.560 --> 13:49.350
The Ring Princesses and their nations,

13:49.350 --> 13:51.910
Mr. Marse and Princess Saphira,

13:51.910 --> 13:55.690
are all normal folks living normal lives.

13:56.940 --> 13:59.610
This world and mine
are not that different.

14:00.570 --> 14:02.570
I think that is great.

14:04.530 --> 14:07.620
Am I sounding like a hero?

14:08.990 --> 14:10.410
Very much so.

14:10.410 --> 14:12.250
Even your expression looks like one.

14:13.580 --> 14:19.090
I never thought
you'd become this way, Satou.

14:21.670 --> 14:23.010
It's getting dark.

14:23.010 --> 14:24.630
Let's head back after we eat this.

14:33.480 --> 14:35.010
I had a lot of fun today.

14:35.480 --> 14:36.400
Thanks.

14:36.400 --> 14:38.360
Oh... Yeah.

14:38.820 --> 14:40.650
I should confirm this.

14:40.650 --> 14:43.400
Can I consider this a date?

14:44.990 --> 14:47.280
That was my intention
in the first place...

14:48.330 --> 14:50.660
I see. It didn't look like a date, huh?

14:50.660 --> 14:52.160
No! Don't get me wrong.

14:52.160 --> 14:55.000
We just never did this before.

14:56.210 --> 15:00.210
I just don't get why you
suddenly asked me out.

15:00.960 --> 15:03.090
We have feelings for each other,

15:03.720 --> 15:06.680
but we've never done the things
normal couples do.

15:07.510 --> 15:09.720
That must feel great.

15:11.850 --> 15:15.640
I want to be like them.

15:17.310 --> 15:19.160
It may sound weird,

15:19.770 --> 15:23.330
but I yearn for that.

15:24.320 --> 15:26.950
I-I see.

15:29.410 --> 15:32.540
But you know,

15:32.540 --> 15:34.710
we shouldn't do it again in this world.

15:37.710 --> 15:40.840
You can't always favor me alone.

15:41.840 --> 15:46.050
The others are your wives as well.

15:47.760 --> 15:50.000
I'm happy with the special treatment.

15:50.760 --> 15:54.680
But it's making things
a lot harder for me.

15:58.480 --> 16:01.910
You carried out your duty
as the Ring King flawlessly.

16:02.520 --> 16:04.070
But I...

16:04.440 --> 16:06.070
Don't be silly!

16:06.070 --> 16:08.160
You're always
the number one in my heart!

16:09.620 --> 16:12.140
No! It has nothing to do
with your place in my heart!

16:12.140 --> 16:13.580
My heart belongs to you alone!

16:18.210 --> 16:21.990
You just can't do that...

16:25.710 --> 16:28.710
The Ring Princesses
carried out their duty

16:29.180 --> 16:32.220
and made the decision to follow you.

16:33.260 --> 16:37.770
You mustn't let their
dedication be in vain.

16:38.810 --> 16:41.480
You are worthy of being the Ring King.

16:41.480 --> 16:44.060
It's all the more reason
to care about the others.

16:45.280 --> 16:47.110
But only you can have my heart.

16:48.450 --> 16:49.910
If you still don't get it...

17:17.349 --> 17:19.560
I really did it!

17:19.560 --> 17:22.690
I just did something
really embarrassing!

17:22.980 --> 17:24.770
L-Let's head back!

17:26.440 --> 17:29.240
No. I don't want to go back.

17:32.280 --> 17:35.160
Only I can have your heart, right?

17:36.330 --> 17:39.200
Hold on... Does it mean...!

17:39.750 --> 17:42.290
Are we really going to do it now?!

17:43.290 --> 17:45.630
It's all right to spend the night outside.

17:47.090 --> 17:48.420
Should I say yes?

17:48.420 --> 17:50.510
No! Now is the time...

17:50.510 --> 17:52.800
...to say this!

17:55.550 --> 17:59.520
Are you spending the night here
or taking a break?

18:00.310 --> 18:04.190
It's doable!
The greatest first experience ever!

18:04.190 --> 18:07.230
Say yes, Satou!

18:08.530 --> 18:11.780
What the hell did I just say?!

18:14.870 --> 18:17.490
Everyone is waiting for us.
Let's head back.

18:20.000 --> 18:22.160
Let's do it another time.

18:37.010 --> 18:40.430
Why should I go too?

18:40.430 --> 18:42.230
You know it, right?

18:42.230 --> 18:44.770
Without the mana
from the Ring Princesses,

18:44.770 --> 18:46.650
the Ring King can't battle the enemies.

18:46.940 --> 18:49.440
Are saying the other three is not enough?

18:49.440 --> 18:53.860
Incredible! There's no limit
to your stamina.

18:55.360 --> 18:58.370
Are you scared of leaving your homeland?

18:58.370 --> 19:00.450
You never struck me
as the cowardly type.

19:00.950 --> 19:04.870
Look at Princess Nephrites,
who was once a home dweller.

19:04.870 --> 19:07.250
Even she came with us.

19:07.250 --> 19:08.710
Yeah.

19:08.710 --> 19:12.920
I'm like an infant
if you compare my age with hers.

19:14.090 --> 19:15.180
That's right.

19:15.180 --> 19:18.050
Let Saphira go on my behalf.

19:18.050 --> 19:20.890
That seems to defeat the purpose.

19:23.350 --> 19:24.710
Just kidding.

19:28.270 --> 19:31.690
Sorry. I never thought
it'd turn like this.

19:32.610 --> 19:35.570
I expected Marse to stay.

19:36.360 --> 19:39.030
No. It's all right, Sister.

19:39.950 --> 19:43.330
Prince Marse has found his purpose.

19:43.910 --> 19:47.670
Besides, I love him because he is

19:47.670 --> 19:49.960
so honest and sincere.

19:50.590 --> 19:51.670
So...

19:51.670 --> 19:54.590
Will you be all right without me?

19:55.380 --> 19:57.090
Don't worry.

19:57.680 --> 19:59.760
While you are away,

19:59.760 --> 20:02.560
Father and I will protect Maasa.

20:03.640 --> 20:06.180
Please stay safe, Sister.

20:07.230 --> 20:12.520
Use the power of your ring
to protect Prince Marse.

20:13.440 --> 20:16.360
Yes. You can count on me.

20:20.280 --> 20:23.950
We are going to the
Kingdom of Earth next.

20:23.950 --> 20:25.330
What is it like?

20:25.830 --> 20:28.330
The Kingdom of Earth, Idanokan.

20:28.330 --> 20:30.670
It's located in the north,
far away from Maasa.

20:30.670 --> 20:34.340
It's a dwarven city standing
on a tall mountain range.

20:34.340 --> 20:36.300
That's what I learned from the books.

20:36.300 --> 20:37.930
Dwarves?

20:37.930 --> 20:41.390
The kind with a beard and a ripped body?

20:41.390 --> 20:42.970
Well...

20:42.970 --> 20:45.600
Are we meeting a dwarven princess?

20:45.600 --> 20:47.140
Well...

20:47.140 --> 20:49.060
Gramps, don't you know anything?

20:50.700 --> 20:53.980
The dwarves went extinct
during the Ring King's battle

20:53.980 --> 20:55.820
with the Abyss King.

20:56.990 --> 21:00.550
There is nothing
but ruins of Idanokan left.

21:00.550 --> 21:02.200
Legend has it

21:02.200 --> 21:06.540
that the people hated outsiders
and were excellent craftsmen.

21:06.540 --> 21:10.710
They followed the Ring King
and fought the Abyss King bravely.

21:10.710 --> 21:14.750
The already small population
was significantly reduced.

21:14.750 --> 21:18.340
After the battle, they lived underground
to hide from the world.

21:18.340 --> 21:20.760
Then, they simply faded
from the world's eyes.

21:21.050 --> 21:26.010
So, there isn't a Ring Princess,
and much less rings.

21:27.770 --> 21:30.730
But we are headed there now.

21:30.730 --> 21:32.730
You must know a thing or two,

21:32.730 --> 21:34.020
Great Sage.

21:36.570 --> 21:37.650
No idea.

21:37.650 --> 21:39.280
- No idea?!
- What?

21:39.280 --> 21:42.860
We'll figure it out once we are there.

21:42.860 --> 21:44.450
If there's nothing we can do,

21:44.450 --> 21:47.290
we can come up with a different solution.

21:48.410 --> 21:49.750
We can see it from here.

21:52.750 --> 21:55.670
The Great Mountain Range of Kaogamika.

21:55.670 --> 21:59.550
Idanokan is located on this
towering mountain range.

22:01.380 --> 22:04.010
All right, we'll travel on foot
from here on.

22:04.010 --> 22:05.890
Let's get moving, guys!

22:05.890 --> 22:07.890
Seriously?!
